WEBVTT

00:19:27.078 --> 00:19:31.166
where being assigned female at birth
is not a disappointment

00:19:31.166 --> 00:19:32.792
or a disadvantage,

00:19:32.792 --> 00:19:34.920
because girls are encouraged,

00:19:34.961 --> 00:19:39.507
empowered and expected to do great things.

00:19:39.507 --> 00:19:42.177
And I can't wait to make that a reality.

00:19:42.636 --> 00:19:43.803
Thank you so much.

00:19:43.845 --> 00:19:50.310
(Applause and cheers)